# A disk episode stays firing through yellow (banshee-dok): one excursion below
# the target range is one incident, closed only on green — matching the app's
# single-identifier disk banner, where red→yellow says nothing. Reverting the
# firing condition to red-only starts recovery the moment red eases, and the
# episode record and the banner tell two different stories again.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/episode.rs
test: a_disk_episode_rides_through_yellow_and_recovers_on_green
---OLD---
        r.band >= Band::Yellow
---NEW---
        r.band == Band::Red
